From 513269ff63d2bf0a6ca9bc125aad3bba61139a25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:48:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Event Timers: world bosses from the player's own map only

This build reaches no A2 Tools service, so the world boss timers players'
meters share through a2tools.app (a2.bossTimers) and their live updates
(a2.followBosses) are off: the plugin no longer asks for feed:boss-timers,
and the world bosses are the ones the player's own map shows. The note
under them says so.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RahWACwaxzLAcYgwc9jk8C
